        "name": "tthorn23",
        "username": "tthorn23",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/tthorn23/{size}/2032_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-17T15:17:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The last update from Lore Forge Games was Feb 13th with a comment by them saying there would be a March update.&nbsp; There was no March update or April.&nbsp; All comments have to be approved and I asked for an update on the updates last Monday and the comment still hasn't been approved.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>At this rate I think GRRM will publish Winds of Winter before we ever see a new Sentinels Tactics game.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:47.680Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
