        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>The last update from Lore Forge Games was Feb 13th with a comment by them saying there would be a March update.&nbsp; There was no March update or April.&nbsp; All comments have to be approved and I asked for an update on the updates last Monday and the comment still hasn't been approved.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At this rate I think GRRM will publish Winds of Winter before we ever see a new Sentinels Tactics game.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
